&_nc_oc=AdpWXjiM9ienQf0HEnHjQwOxBhKwiWUl2GA6NVGS6TzkhR1O_qnuFS68vvTMeFJv0yo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4GNxsK7WFuhr3xi2lkMMWF86IpVYE4OBwmnqC_fM9a6g&oe=6A15B93E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UwDsrYivDNYQ7kNvwFQPPql&_nc_oc=AdqQWuejYsk6WIxAURGOs4mHSAlYZLiXnFBT-6EQUtKlH9PVxwRtYEzUiuAAeLbvt5U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5TzPT74nT0JcZqoUDRKmNVeN-3ZNq0VsuWYCA_akS3Pw&oe=6A1591FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_IzIRPmLpYkQ7kNvwFjVte6&_nc_oc=AdrbCUtqE4oTHkipmTDdaEbp8m0lltweqmMLQosQxiDibx9La80VS62fLkFOaVpw_B4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5C0tsgyy7APba6nmxPitJ-79Jx00o7XylIhNm4kEBJ-A&oe=6A15B087"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5fx86Ojj-JoQ7kNvwGHQtjr&_nc_oc=AdoH-Whrjp-9ZDm3Uztib57J-PYgnPAt7hl9AY6fG5jkg7g-C60ono18-n20giWNezg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5wLgH1a_k4BaLhE1l3bGKbpRZ1OiT9kbPhFvn6VfCtpQ&oe=6A159C55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c_1SFgKafccQ7kNvwGJL0ds&_nc_oc=AdpTMAS7MaLM0Ds4d_kTc8_gLLh7QLa-agWBkBX3Fb9uxMfsCShoHIWArC4pZIXnPNw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6zfE_lVIwgmG-vc0tqSLQyy02PxgI3LPYeQ35alYug5w&oe=6A15A8E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.